e forward whenever required for any service.","alignment":{"type":"grouped","confidence":1.0,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-3-55-9"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"3053015","sanskritFile":"Ram03.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"24bfcd17f07f6d373d5e80ebc63824c62143b6a49907ec805cfb4a0b35deac96","compact":"4c28de3acf0689b2167c5c1a1bcb5858134f413e0ea64246cab3d95a91784844","nasal":"4c28de3acf0689b2167c5c1a1bcb5858134f413e0ea64246cab3d95a91784844"}},{"id":"VRCE-3-53-16","kanda":3,"kandaId":"aranya","sarga":53,"verse":16,"english":"If such is my sovereignty, all this is established in you, O large-eyed lady, as well as my life. You are dearer to me than life.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":1.0,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-3-55-10"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"3053016","sanskritFile":"Ram03.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"7004e6811a35442561bf6803ebbc5b9dbc6af30756dbf5c7047038a4d8959360","compact":"9c3a262b66aa99914a51c43e80a98da79843215649ca14f4494f4076a7fe9248","nasal":"4179352f226bd1c475fb9d02bebcef30d6cedf95a91556765bd3964bd6f3c07d"}},{"id":"VRCE-3-53-17","kanda":3,"kandaId":"aranya","sarga":53,"verse":17,"english":"O Sītā, be you the mistress of those numerous excellent women who are my wives. Dear, be you my wife.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.714,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-3-55-11"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"3053017","sanskritFile":"Ram03.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"d08609081f756ef83a73712c7adb5d921329b522b22e622fa353eda8b3fb5265","compact":"163f20bc7c6b56b81f4b8b06729b8af46659ad3a15d76779653ad90f1fadb09b","nasal":"163f20bc7c6b56b81f4b8b06729b8af46659ad3a15d76779653ad90f1fadb09b"}},{"id":"VRCE-3-53-18","kanda":3,"kandaId":"aranya","sarga":53,"verse":18,"english":"This is for your good. Why should you act otherwise? Do you relish my speech. Do you bend your mind towards me. It behoves you to favour me, who am burning in the heat of desire).","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.869,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-3-55-12"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"3053018","sanskritFile":"Ram03.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"175abe7186aa32338ca05cdb7eb2acc22d38670d1a468607659f7f205219d45b","compact":"5785bdf9b504e2ebc2288f47019ad614705c59d91be62e44d9c1b36f33d5bc70","nasal":"5785bdf9b504e2ebc2288f47019ad614705c59d91be62e44d9c1b36f33d5bc70"}},{"id":"VRCE-3-53-19","kanda":3,"kandaId":"aranya","sarga":53,"verse":19,"english":"This Larkă measuring an hundred Yojanas girt round by the ocean, is incapable of being harassed by the celestials themselves headed by Indra.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.875,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-3-55-13"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"3053019","sanskritFile":"Ram03.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"4f838ee55e5a762b89cb8f8c756184df6c9191667e06957426b205aead2a3239","compact":"cc717c2270ed54ac7a7c634f8d2afd6d2391a23bef0a7e4e54a912cba1e85bbd","nasal":"349fe4009df117568d5710cabcd0c99f734632e475fb9e6adbcafbeea5c86882"}},{"id":"VRCE-3-53-20","kanda":3,"kandaId":"aranya","sarga":53,"verse":20,"english":"Neither among the celestials nor Yakşãs nor Gandharvas nor Serpents, find I any one that can match me in prowess.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":1.0,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-3-55-14"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"3053020","sanskritFile":"Ram03.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"11d4e5ff533db5925ece57344eebb2f2e4a738aa9c1bd1e1f533c5b52ea19126","compact":"65b6825a4c931decad020f3c71e3f13f5e6fa3cced04c0c065c9ec177640627d","nasal":"731ec0320873a90de7b8e8ea701ba0a1cc9d4c7d6f14e42264d3c335d0a59457"}},{"id":"VRCE-3-53-21","kanda":3,"kandaId":"aranya","sarga":53,"verse":21,"english":"What will you do with Rāma a human being of short life, poor, of small prowess, practising mendicancy?","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.589,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-3-55-15"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"3053021","sanskritFile":"Ram03.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"e3d6ae67b10f1a5b468981a6048d805b95092e433f182dd8987bf38a9ae0add3","compact":"4622fd187b5f0f9b08220270db8f6f568e1b93e475fbfd6a6c0a029b38484607","nasal":"4622fd187b5f0f9b08220270db8f6f568e1b93e475fbfd6a6c0a029b38484607"}},{"id":"VRCE-3-53-22","kanda":3,"kandaId":"aranya","sarga":53,"verse":22,"english":"O Sītā, bend your mind to me. I am a fit husband for you. O timed one, youth is uncertain. Sport with me here.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.808,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-3-55-16"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"3053022","sanskritFile":"Ram03.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"35f3186ad89b26a7a782aefd6c6d3272c9357a907d89930b87b9e18c990c8c60","compact":"009d95b0bcd2901bf84305a4355baae75b7a8e3904a6124e763b6f3e3abbaced","nasal":"009d95b0bcd2901bf84305a4355baae75b7a8e3904a6124e763b6f3e3abbaced"}},{"id":"VRCE-3-53-23","kanda":3,"kandaId":"aranya","sarga":53,"verse":23,"english":"And, O you of a handsome countenance, do not wish for the sight of Rāghava. O Sītā, what power has he to come hither even in thought?","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.879,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-3-55-17"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"3053023","sanskritFile":"Ram03.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"7450acf53d02033806d79b20aa1a3e6bd348a03c4b400119c3eca2d88a3f4749","compact":"83d677e9b8cd8e6cbc234f96903d3